{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "There is a whale that sings,",
   "start": 0.07,
   "end": 1.487
  },
  {
   "text": "and no one sings back.",
   "start": 1.487,
   "end": 3.42
  },
  {
   "text": "In 1989,",
   "start": 4.04,
   "end": 5.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Navy microphones built to hunt submarines picked up a strange song in the Pacific.",
   "start": 5.38,
   "end": 11.04
  },
  {
   "text": "A whale, singing at 52 hertz.",
   "start": 11.37,
   "end": 13.27
  },
  {
   "text": "Other big whales sing far lower.",
   "start": 13.89,
   "end": 15.64
  },
  {
   "text": "For 12 years,",
   "start": 16.27,
   "end": 17.3
  },
  {
   "text": "scientists followed the song across the ocean.",
   "start": 17.38,
   "end": 19.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Season after season, it called.",
   "start": 20.31,
   "end": 22.36
  },
  {
   "text": "And in all those years,",
   "start": 22.97,
   "end": 24.09
  },
  {
   "text": "they never heard a second voice like it.",
   "start": 24.44,
   "end": 26.37
  },
  {
   "text": "No one has ever even seen it.",
   "start": 26.91,
   "end": 28.26
  },
  {
   "text": "They call it the loneliest whale in the world.",
   "start": 28.91,
   "end": 31.41
  },
  {
   "text": "Some of us know that feeling.",
   "start": 32.29,
   "end": 33.57
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 34.08,
   "end": 35.36
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny always answers, day or night.",
   "start": 35.86,
   "end": 38.19
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 38.75,
   "end": 40.25
  }
 ]
}